  "body": "For example, an [Eddystone-URL](https://github.com/google/eddystone/tree/master/eddystone-url) beacon can cause the browser to suggest a user visit a particular web page. If the user does, that page could get direct access to the device instead of needing to go through the `requestDevice()` chooser.\n\nSketch at https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jFCTyq84T2fLc8ZhxorTz3u_gCk59hp17EmkFgaDQ2c/edit?usp=sharing.\n",
